---
description: Building or changing screens. Use the shared component library and the T&T theme.
globs: app/**/*.tsx, components/**/*.tsx
---

- Build screens from `@/components/library`. Do not create one-off buttons, inputs, cards or status pills.
- Colours come from the `asm-*` Tailwind utilities (see `styles/library-theme.css`). Never write hex values outside `styles/tokens.css`.
- Wrap new screens in `asm-root`.
- Engagement status uses `DeliveryStatus` (glyph + label + wash). Other short states use `Badge` with words.
- Every string comes from `lib/copy.ts` with a Welsh equivalent in `lib/copy.cy.ts`.
- Engagement screens read `trpc.spine.get` and invalidate `spine.get` and `spine.board` after mutations.
- New library components need a guide in `components/library/guides.ts` and an example in `Catalogue.tsx`.
- Reference: `docs/redesign/README.md`.
